# ytbrain .gitignore — what is NOT part of the repository (github.com/kaushalag29/founder-coach, private).
# Tracked on purpose (README "What's in git"): code (ytbrain/, founder_coach/ incl. the generated
# product.json and playbooks/, scripts/, ops/), tests/ (incl. golden/), plugin/ (the template),
# eval/ (the released benchmark), docs/ (ADRs, plans, research, archive), the top-level docs
# (README, CHANGELOG, SECURITY, LICENSE, AGENTS, CLAUDE, CONTEXT), templates (.env.example,
# sources.example.yaml), product.toml, pyproject.toml, .github/, and uv.lock / .python-version if added.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never commit. Copy .env.example to .env and fill it in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.netrc
.pypirc
credentials.json
token.json
client_secret*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pipeline data — everything ytbrain downloads or generates: captions (the
# uploaders' content), transcripts, records, pages, the LanceDB index, the
# manifest database, lock file and run log. Rebuild with `ytbrain run`.
# Set YTBRAIN_ROOT to keep it outside the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
/manifest.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
# partial files from interrupted downloads/writes, and leftovers of applying patches
*.orig
*.rej
*.part
*.ytdl
*.tmp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal configuration and private founder data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# your playlist list — the tracked template is sources.example.yaml
/sources.yaml
# The Founder's data (store, Feedback, usage log) lives in ~/.<product id> (ADR-0012). These
# catch it if FOUNDER_COACH_HOME or an --out folder ever points inside the repo. Keep the
# patterns specific: a bare `feedback/` would also hide plugin/skills/feedback/.
.ytbrain/
.founder-coach/
founder.db
founder.db-*
FOUNDER.md
founder-export.json
feedback-*.jsonl
usage.jsonl*
before-restore-*/
# copies of the plan docs made for the Project; the files in docs/ are the ones to keep
docs/ytbrain-docs/
# a half-finished build of scripts/assemble_plugin.py (normally inside dist/)
.plugin.building-*
# eval: the benchmark in eval/ is tracked; run results live in data/eval/ (ignored)
eval/private/
# local Claude / agent settings (shared settings.json may be committed)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
CLAUDE.local.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / uv
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
wheels/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.pyre/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.tox/
.nox/
*.whl
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*~
